# 【移除 broker】kafka-remove-brokers --delete:副本搬走、筆數不變、broker 自動關機
$ kafka-remove-brokers --broker-id 14 --delete / --describe
移除前:sbc.data 筆數 80000;broker 15 上的副本數:115
▶ 下一個指令:kafka-remove-brokers --delete。它先把 broker 排除在新副本之外,再把它的副本搬走,最後關機
Initiating remove brokers call...
Started remove broker task for brokers [15].
You can check its status by calling this command again with the `--describe` option.
   218 秒後:移除作業完成(最多 10 分鐘)
  Broker 15 removal status - SUCCESS. Sub-task statuses:
    Broker Replica Exclusion: COMPLETED
    Partition Reassignment: COMPLETED
    Broker Shutdown: COMPLETED
    Shutdown Scheduled: true
移除後:sbc.data 筆數 80000;broker 15 上的副本數:0;容器狀態:Exited (0) 15 seconds ago
判定:broker 15 的副本全部搬走、資料筆數不變(80000)、broker 已自動關機;不需要手寫搬移計畫
